-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("en",269,{
[8577]="7005339A\n1\tCollect medallions of loyalty from Sharkey's Men\t\n2\tCollect medallions of loyalty from Sharkey's Men (total: 5)\tMedallions of loyalty are carried by the highest-ranking brigands and half-orcs in the warrens of Tûn Melen. You have discovered curious medallions carried by the brigands and half-orcs in the warrens of Tûn Melen. Emblazoned with an 'S', they denote proven loyalty to Sharkey. You should strip them from their bearers and keep them to return to Radagast.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have collected a few medallions of loyalty from Sharkey's Men in the warrens of Tûn Melen.\n",
[8578]="700404D0\n1\tMeet Gladion at the Corsair encampment\tGladion has run off to the Corsair encampment in north-eastern Lamedon. You should search for Gladion at the Corsair encampment.\n2\tSearch for signs of Fuirion\tFuirion might be somewhere within the Corsair encampment in north-eastern Lamedon. You should search the tents for signs of Fuirion.\n3\tSpeak with Hebil, captain of the Corsairs\tHebil, captain of the Corsairs in the Lamedon encampment, can be found in the Corsairs' encampment in north-eastern Lamedon. You should speak with Hebil.\n",
[8579]="70015215\n1\tFind and defeat Urbhrum\tBy the flight of the arrows, Ansurr believes Urbhrum can be found amid the fungus-covered Orcs of the Water-works. Ansurr has asked you to find and defeat Urbhrum near The Chamber of Dark Waters, east of Hulwul-nefekh.\n2\tTalk to Ansurr at Hulwul-nefekh\tAnsurr is in Hulwul-nefekh, west of The Chamber of Dark Waters. You should return to Ansurr and inform him of your victory against the infected Urbhrum.\n",
[8580]="70037E5B\n1\tFind the crate of supplies\tThe supplies can be found at the attacked caravan just off of the road, north of Aldburg. Wilflad asked if you would retrieve the crate of supplies that she was expecting.\n2\tTalk to Wilflad\tWilflad is in Aldburg to the south. You should bring the crate of supplies to Wilflad.\n",
[8581]="7001905F\n1\tTalk to Saelthaliel at the Horse-fields in Bree\tSaelthaliel and the Elves with her should be at the Festival Grounds in Bree, in the Horse-fields to the north of Bree-town. Calendui has asked you to speak with Saelthaliel to remind her not to tarry too long at Bree's Spring Planting, lest she miss the Ethuilwereth celebration altogether.\n",
[8582]="70030B57\n1\tObserve Oldheart's memory\tThe Ent Oldheart is at the head of a clearing south of the Black Heart. You should speak with Oldheart and observe his memories.\n2\tTalk to Oldheart\tThe Ent Oldheart is at the head of a clearing south of the Black Heart. You should speak with Oldheart once more.\n",
[8583]="7003A4EB\n1\tFind Tova's missing locket\tThe boar-totem is south-east of Fenmarch. Tova asked if you could find her locket, which she thinks she lost near the boar-totem that she discovered.\n2\tTalk to Tova\tTova is near the western entrance of Fenmarch. You were able to find Tova's missing locket near the boar-totem and should now return it to Tova.\n",
[8584]="700282D1\n1\tRescue the prisoners from the Dievlig\tHaul is at Echad Naeglanc in the Bonevales. You should speak with Haul when you are ready to track down the Dievlig who captured his companions.\n2\tSpeak to Haul\tSpeak to Haul in Echad Naeglanc in the Bonevales. With several of the prisoners free, you may begin investigating what is happening within the Bonevales.\n",
[8585]="7000005D\n1\tFind Anlaf's missing cart\030Find the driver of the missing cart\tAnlaf's missing cart travelled west towards Bree along the Great East Road. Anlaf has asked that you search north and south of the cart's estimated route to learn its fate and the fate of its driver.\n2\tTalk to Anlaf the Forlorn\tAnlaf is at the Forsaken Inn. You discovered that the cart was destroyed, its supplies stolen, and the driver killed by the nearby goblins. Anlaf should be given this unfortunate news.\n",
[8586]="70009E25\n1\tLalfor has given you a list of his missing things to remind you exactly what they are. Lalfor would like you to find his missing things while he remains close to the Festival of Enedhin for...research purposes.\t\n2\tReturn the five items to Lalfor\030Collect Lalfor's Goblet\030Collect Lalfor's Jewellery Box\030Collect Lalfor's Blue Book\030Collect Lalfor's Brown Book\030Collect Lalfor's Bundle of Books\030Collect Lalfors's List\tLalfor is waiting for you at the festival in Duillond. Lalfor will be pleased to have all his missing items returned to him.\n",
[8587]="70041241\n1\tDefeat Orcs in the Dead Marshes, and remain alert for clues to Artamir's location\tArtamir never returned to his camp, and you have resolved to fight the Orcs and search for any clue the creatures may have to his location.\n2\tArtamir never returned to his camp, and you have resolved to fight the Orcs and search for any clue the creatures may have to his location.\t\n3\tReturn to Artamir's camp to see if the Gondorian man has returned\tYou found an Orkish map with one location encircled in blood. You should return to Artamir's camp to see if the Gondorian man has returned, but if he has not, you may have learned the next place to search for the missing man.\n4\tCheck Artamir's bedroll to ensure it was not slept in while you were away, and then find the location circled on the map\tArtamir has still not returned to his camp, but you found an Orkish map with a location encircled in blood. Perhaps this will give some clue to the Gondorian man's location. Check Artamir's bedroll to ensure it was not slept in while you were away, and then you can depart for the location on the map.\n5\tTalk to Artamir at his camp in the Dead Marshes\tYou rescued Artamir from a sad end in the Dead Marshes, and should speak to him back at his camp.\n",
[8588]="7003049A\n1\tGísling mentioned that he saw trees being marked with weaponry, especially around Snowbourn's weakest walls. Fastred wants you to investigate his claim that Snowbourn is being marked by the forces of the Enemy marshalling in the Sutcrofts.\t\n2\tTalk to Fastred\tFastred can be found in the Mead Hall of Snowbourn. You should return to Fastred with news of your discoveries.\n",
[8589]="70009A5D\n1\tTalk to Ronald Dwale's friends at The Bird and Baby Inn\tThe Bird and Baby Inn is in Michel Delving, west across the road from Town Hole. Ronald Dwale has asked you to speak with his friends at The Bird and Baby Inn and let them know that he will not be able to make their next meeting.\n2\tTalk to Ronald Dwale at the Bullroarer's Sward\tRonald Dwale is at Hob Hillbrow's home at the Bullroarer's Sward in Dwaling. You should return to Ronald Dwale and inform him that you completed his task.\n",
[8590]="70019062\n1\tTalk to Gísi at the Horse-fields in Bree\tGísi is at the Festival Grounds in Bree, near the hedge-maze on the Horse-fields. You should bring Mákr's message to Gísi before the festival days come to a close for the season.\n",
[8591]="700582E1\n1\tDefeat worms at Kidzul-kâlah (total: 10)\tYour mission is to repel a pack of worms encroaching on Kidzul-kâlah.\n",
[8592]="700582E7\n1\tComplete 'Mission: A Chill on the Gladdenmere'\tYour mission is to repel a pack of worms encroaching on Kidzul-kâlah. You should talk to Ausma and travel to Kidzul-kâlah.\n2\tTalk to Ausma\tYou have completed your mission. You should talk to Ausma for your reward.\n",
[8593]="70071DF1\n1\tComplete Mission: A Cleansing Fire\tYour mission is to travel to Jâr Obadal and set alight the spiders' webbed burrows and cull their number. Speak to Jôrlar to travel.\n2\tSpeak with Jôrlar in Zajâna\tYou have defeated the spiders and destroyed their nests. Return with the scout to Jôrlar in Zajâna with this report.\n",
[8594]="7006907C\n1\tComplete Mission: A Cut Above\tYour mission is to take the fight to Ghasaphâr and his Corsairs. Root them out of their settlement in Kan Skûrja on the Cape of Umbar. Speak to Malthak to travel.\n2\tTalk to Malthak\tYou have successfully defeated Ghasaphâr and the Corsairs! Return to the mission giver.\n",
[8595]="7006907B\n1\tComplete Mission: A Dark Treasure\tYour mission is to travel to Bakhjâd and obtain a great stolen treasure cache by whatever means necessary. Speak to Deshra to travel.\n2\tYou have successfully defeated the Corsairs and the Dead and recovered the cache! Return to the mission giver with this report.\t\n",
[8596]="70062FC1\n1\tClose shrew burrows (total: 6)\t\n2\tRepel craban invaders (total: 8)\t\n3\tFind and speak with the Scout\t\n",
[8597]="70063037\n1\tComplete the Mission: A Day on the Farm\tAn odd request to help out on a nearby farm in Lhunach. Speak to the mission giver to head down to the farm and help.\n2\tTalk to Irvo Curch\tAfter an eventful day on the farm, it is time to return to the mission giver who asked you to go and help the famers with their work.\n",
[8598]="70066B5A\n1\tDefeat Corsairs in the ruins ([see journal]/12)\tYou steel yourself for the challenge ahead. You can hear voices, boisterously cheering for the spoils they recovered.\n2\tDefeat Hilâma\030Defeat Yarikh\tSearching deeper within the ruins you hear Yarikh's voice speaking with his last lieutenant, Hilâma. Find them and confront them.\n3\tCollect the haversack\tThe villains are gone. You have closed the circle of vengeance that began the mariner's tale many years ago. Collect his haversack and return to him.\n4\tReturn to the entrance of the tomb\tReturn to the entrance and to Falnavar.\n",
[8599]="70057F1C\n1\tComplete Mission: A Frosty Reception\tYour mission is to find and free the captured scouts in Vorkodar. Speak to Ausma to travel to Vorkodar.\n2\tTalk to Ausma\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Ausma for your reward!\n",
[8600]="70057F20\n1\tFree the first captured scout\030Free the second captured scout\030Free the third captured scout\030Free the fourth captured scout\tFind and free the captured dwarf scouts in Vorkodar.\n",
[8601]="7006E4D6\n1\tComplete Mission: A Gift for the North\tYou have been asked to enter Olwir's camp and foil his plans to capture a Stone-toll and deliver it to Skorgrím as a gift.\n2\tTalk to the Hooded Stranger in The Prancing Pony\tYou have stopped Olwir's plans and defeated the Stone-troll. You should talk to Ulfar and then give your report to the Hooded Stranger.\n",
[8602]="7005859D\n1\tDefeat Stúrkvith the Bloated\tYour mission is to defeat the gluttonous rock-worm, Stúrkvith the Bloated, who now dwells in Scatha's Larder.\n",
[8603]="7005859E\n1\tComplete 'Mission: A Glutton in the Larder'\tYour mission is to defeat the gluttonous rock-worm, Stúrkvith the Bloated, who now dwells in Scatha's Larder. You should talk to Ausma and travel to Scatha's Larder.\n2\tTalk to Ausma\tYou have completed your mission. You should talk to Ausma for your reward.\n",
[8604]="7006EC03\n1\tComplete Mission: A Hearty Meal\tYour mission is to travel to Shegdush and gather eggs and thin the numbers of chickens and boars in the area. Speak to Setokúli to travel.\n2\tTalk to Setokúli\tYour mission is to travel to Shegdush and gather eggs and thin the numbers of chickens and boars in the area. Return with the scout to Setokúli with this report.\n",
[8605]="7005CACA\n1\tComplete Mission: A Large Problem\tYour mission is to thwart a group of stone-giants within the rocky slopes of Câr Bronach. Speak to Ausma to travel.\n2\tTalk to Ausma\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Ausma for your reward!\n",
[8606]="7005CAD3\n1\tDestroy boulder piles (total: 8)\030Destroy worm nests (total: 8)\030Sour the giants' soup (total: 4)\tYou should destroy worm nests, boulder piles, and sour the giants' soup.\n2\tYou should return to the entrance of the dungeon\tYou should return to the entrance of the dungeon.\n",
[8607]="7006675D\n1\tSpeak with the mariner\tThe time was mid-autumn in the harbour town of Pelargir. I arrived only a moment before my friend. As he entered, he approached and we spoke.\n2\tRead the poster\tI made my way toward the bar, not noticing yet that the inn was bereft of clients, something that should have alerted me to the curious nature of the night. Along the way, a posting caught my eye....\n3\tSpeak with the mariner\tThe poster was meant to entice the reader to the sea, to service, on some it had that effect. On others...\n4\tSpeak with the mariner\tWe made our way to the bar and took up the flagons....\n5\tDrink with the mariner\tI raised my flagon and awaited the same of my friend. Our toast, however, was only the beginning of a harrowing event....\n6\tSpeak with the Mariner\tFor in the back of the inn, Corsairs had set to plunder. Killing the innkeep after he dared ask them for payment for the drinks we now consumed....\n7\tDefeat Corsair cutthroats ([see journal]/6)\tThere were no more words between us. The Corsairs drew blades and we fought. It were not luck that brought us through....\n8\tSpeak with the Captain\tWas it in the commotion that the captain appeared? It was unclear. I only know that after the fight was done, there they were....\n9\tReturn to the Mariner\tThe Captain's words lingered with me as I rejoined my friend.\n",
[8608]="70069717\n1\tComplete Mission: A Life's Work\tOn the northern Shield Isle Ghax-hophra, a distinguished Umbari scholar lost his priceless research when he was attacked by large beetles. Your mission is to recover the research and destroy these creatures' nests. Speak to Malthak to travel.\n2\tSpeak with Malthak\tYou have successfully recovered the research and defeated the Ghax-hophra brood! Return with the Umbari scout to Malthak with this report.\n",
})
